; FBX 7.4.0 project file
; A test model written by hand for Open Wallpaper Engine's importer tests: a quad skinned to a
; two-bone chain (Root, Tip one unit up), its lower corners on Root and its upper ones on Tip,
; and one animation stack ("Wave", 1 s at 30 fps) turning Tip 90 degrees about z. Each cluster's
; Transform is the bone's inverse bind times the mesh's, as exporters write it.
